    <description>Part of Unsubscribe Link package from AppExchange 4/4

Type-in screen. Collects the address the Recipient types and returns it to Unsubscribe Link Quick, which records a Pending Unsubscribe Request. It doesn&apos;t look up Contacts or Leads: the batch decides whether the address matches (ADR 0002), so the page can&apos;t be used to test which addresses the org has.</description>
